1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
How easy it is for a teammate to join, chat, and support the group.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
One tap to join a project your teammate already created.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:12,500
Paste the link (or scan the QR code), type your name, and tap Join — that's it.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,500
No separate onboarding maze — straight to the shared dashboard.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Everyone in the group shares one live chat feed.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
One-on-one messages stay separate from the group feed — pick a teammate and reply privately.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Falling more than 20% behind the group's pace? GroupMate flags it automatically — no one has to guess who's stuck.

8
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,500
GroupMate — built with Gradio, Supabase, and the OpenAI API.

